  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "下一个最值钱的岗位，可能叫营销工程师",
      "startMs": 250,
      "endMs": 3437,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "一个人，带着一群AI Agent",
      "startMs": 3557,
      "endMs": 6535,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "做营销实验的速度，是传统团队的上百倍",
      "startMs": 6655,
      "endMs": 10782,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "广告狂人时代，一年只有几次出手机会",
      "startMs": 11152,
      "endMs": 14078,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "搜索广告出现后，每次点击都能算清",
      "startMs": 14198,
      "endMs": 17306,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "增长黑客时代，每个点子都要排队等工程师",
      "startMs": 17426,
      "endMs": 20796,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "现在，提想法的人自己就能做出来",
      "startMs": 20916,
      "endMs": 24208,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "营销的单位，从一次活动变成一套系统",
      "startMs": 24328,
      "endMs": 27880,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "第一步，准备一个Agent工作台",
      "startMs": 28250,
      "endMs": 30915,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Claude Code、Codex、Cursor都行",
      "startMs": 31035,
      "endMs": 34222,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "把它当成住在文件夹里的高速实习生",
      "startMs": 34342,
      "endMs": 37320,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "再用MCP把CRM、收款、文档接进来",
      "startMs": 37440,
      "endMs": 41828,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "让它每周一早上自动开工",
      "startMs": 41948,
      "endMs": 44169,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "但对外发送前，一定要等你点头",
      "startMs": 44289,
      "endMs": 46770,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "最常见的失败：一上来就开十个Agent",
      "startMs": 47140,
      "endMs": 50327,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "结果收获一堆千篇一律的废话",
      "startMs": 50447,
      "endMs": 52850,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "先建一个文件夹，像给新员工做入职培训",
      "startMs": 52970,
      "endMs": 56732,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "写清公司做什么、卖给谁、能承诺什么",
      "startMs": 56852,
      "endMs": 60039,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "品牌语气别写形容词，直接贴好坏样例",
      "startMs": 60159,
      "endMs": 64495,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "再写下创始人观点和踩过的坑",
      "startMs": 64615,
      "endMs": 67332,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "接通通话录音、工单、成交和收入数据",
      "startMs": 67702,
      "endMs": 71202,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "一开始全部只读，写权限要慢慢挣",
      "startMs": 71322,
      "endMs": 74562,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "最关键的一件小事：每个活动一个编号",
      "startMs": 74682,
      "endMs": 77973,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "广告、链接、邮件、成交记录都带上它",
      "startMs": 78093,
      "endMs": 81724,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "才能算清：哪次营销带来了真付钱的客户",
      "startMs": 81844,
      "endMs": 85266,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "先把一个Agent做好，再做第二个",
      "startMs": 85636,
      "endMs": 88483,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "第一个，专门读客户原话",
      "startMs": 88603,
      "endMs": 90876,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "把最近20到50通销售录音交给它",
      "startMs": 90996,
      "endMs": 94418,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "第一版大概七成准，错了就改指令",
      "startMs": 94538,
      "endMs": 98300,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "比如客户总说：受够了吃饭时接电话",
      "startMs": 98420,
      "endMs": 101345,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "这句话，就是你的广告标题",
      "startMs": 101465,
      "endMs": 104051,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "稳定之后，一次只加一个",
      "startMs": 104421,
      "endMs": 106642,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "触发Agent：盯住刚开新店、刚融资的客户",
      "startMs": 106762,
      "endMs": 110393,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "搜索Agent：为买前问题做最有用的页面",
      "startMs": 110513,
      "endMs": 113752,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "创意Agent：换卖点，而不是换五十个标题",
      "startMs": 113872,
      "endMs": 117059,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "丢单Agent：客户要的功能上线就去提醒",
      "startMs": 117179,
      "endMs": 120418,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "效果Agent：每周一给出保留或砍掉的结论",
      "startMs": 120538,
      "endMs": 124300,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "别指望提示词里那句“先问我”",
      "startMs": 124670,
      "endMs": 127204,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "真正的护栏，要写进工具权限",
      "startMs": 127324,
      "endMs": 129910,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "外联Agent只能存草稿，广告默认暂停",
      "startMs": 130030,
      "endMs": 133452,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "预算上限、黑名单这类硬规则交给代码",
      "startMs": 133572,
      "endMs": 136550,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "合不合适这种判断，才交给模型",
      "startMs": 136670,
      "endMs": 139256,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "比如一家记账公司想接电商客户",
      "startMs": 139626,
      "endMs": 142473,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "周一，报告发现店主总在问同一句话",
      "startMs": 142593,
      "endMs": 146015,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "扣掉退货和运费，我到底赚没赚钱？",
      "startMs": 146135,
      "endMs": 149191,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "周二，各个Agent用这句原话出广告和页面",
      "startMs": 149311,
      "endMs": 153178,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "周三，你一次审完，砍掉夸大的广告",
      "startMs": 153298,
      "endMs": 156354,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "两周后，计算器页面转化最好",
      "startMs": 156474,
      "endMs": 159321,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "系统搭好后，你的工作更像编辑",
      "startMs": 159691,
      "endMs": 162408,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "周一看备忘录做取舍，周四去听销售和客服",
      "startMs": 162528,
      "endMs": 166655,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "每次否掉一个东西，写下原因放回大脑",
      "startMs": 166775,
      "endMs": 170641,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "给每个Agent留十个样例，改完就重测",
      "startMs": 170761,
      "endMs": 174314,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "做市场的，先用20通录音做客户语言Agent",
      "startMs": 174684,
      "endMs": 178759,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "做工程的，先旁听5通销售电话",
      "startMs": 178879,
      "endMs": 181805,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "做老板的，花两小时写下你的观点",
      "startMs": 181925,
      "endMs": 184772,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "觉得有用，收藏起来，转给做营销的朋友",
      "startMs": 184892,
      "endMs": 188706,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ]
